.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-config\-inspect\-paths \- Inspect relevant paths
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq config inspect paths\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Inspect relevant paths.
.PP
Prints paths that are used by sq, such as the location of the home directory, the configuration file, the certificate store, the key store, etc. 
.PP

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Inspect relevant paths.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq config inspect paths
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\fR(1), \fBsq\-config\-inspect\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
